description = "A program that uses `inductive_syntax!` runs in a case as `tauto run` runs it: the kernel's own functions it brings in are not read as a program."

@ cases.inductive-syntax-program-shows
files."main.taut" = ````tauto
import std::text { Text }
inductive_syntax!(sw, ```par
%start Pair
%%
Pair: X Y;
X: 'x';
Y: 'y';
```) => struct Pair, fn parse, inductive Pair::I, fn Pair::to_i
show(&"y")
````
entry = "main.taut"
stdout = ```
"y"
```
